  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/326/luckymap.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"410\" height=\"68\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本地圖為幸運方塊地圖，最多可容納 4 名玩家遊玩。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">支援 1 至 4 人遊玩。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如遇問題請與我們聯繫。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/327/mapp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"68\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/347/3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/345/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/346/2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>",
